### GET transform 400(bimetal):raw
GET http://localhost:8000/transform?lemma-id=400&target=raw

###

### POST transform 400(bimetal):raw
POST http://localhost:8000/transform
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lemma-id": "400",
  "target": "raw"
}

